# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (both use the repo root).
# Everything is rebuilt inside the image: never send local builds, deps or generated data.
# Patterns are anchored at the context root, hence the **/ prefixes.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-e2e
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/lighthouse-report
**/perf-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.duckdb
**/.duckdb
apps/api/data

# Not needed to build or run
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea
docs
tests
**/e2e
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.mjs
**/*.log

# Secrets never enter an image (Vite would even inline VITE_* values into the public bundle).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
